    {
      "text": "To use tags for contracts, you must add tag categories and tags for each category. You can add a maximum of 8 tag categories, and each category can consist of 8 tags."
    },
    {
      "text": "To add a tag category and tags:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Applications > Application Settings > Tag Management > Contract Tags.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          18
        ],
        [
          21,
          41
        ],
        [
          44,
          58
        ],
        [
          61,
          74
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Create Tag Category.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          25
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Create New Tag Category drawer appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          27
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Create New Tag Category drawer:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          30
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: Enter a name for the tag category.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Color: Select a color to represent the tag category.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          5
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Type: Select Manual or Dynamic. Manual tagging is individual linking of contracts to a tag. Dynamic tagging allows you to configure criteria-based automatic tagging of contracts.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ],
        [
          13,
          19
        ],
        [
          23,
          30
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Manual",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: Enter the tag name.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Contracts: Select the contracts that you want to link to this tag.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Add Tag to add more tags to the category. Note that only one tag in a category can be linked to a contract.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Dynamic",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Criteria: Select one of the following criteria based on which the contracts are dynamically linked to a tag:",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "TCV",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "ACV",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Seller Name",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Application",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Vendor",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "License",
      "depth": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: Enter the tag name.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Operator: Select an operator to set the threshold to satisfy the criteria as greater than (>), greater than or equal to (>=), less than (<), less than or equal to (<=), equal to (=), Is, Is not, Contains, or Not Contains.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ],
        [
          91,
          92
        ],
        [
          121,
          123
        ],
        [
          137,
          138
        ],
        [
          164,
          166
        ],
        [
          179,
          180
        ],
        [
          183,
          185
        ],
        [
          187,
          193
        ],
        [
          195,
          203
        ],
        [
          208,
          220
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Value: Enter the value for the selected criteria.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          5
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "For example, the following GIF shows how to configure a dynamic tag for linking contracts that have an annual contract value (ACV) of $10K or less to the Low ACV tag, and more than $10K to the High ACV tag.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The tag category is successfully added. You can view the tag category and its tags on the Contract Tags page.",
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
}
